{"unit_id": "tag:01PX:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme），设<MATH_0002>为可逆（invertible）的<MATH_0003>-模（module）。假设开集（sets）<MATH_0004>（其中<MATH_0005>且<MATH_0006>）构成<MATH_0007>上拓扑（topology）的一个基（basis）。那么，在上述开集（opens）中，开集（sets）<MATH_0008>里仿射的（affine）那些构成<MATH_0009>上拓扑（topology）的一个基（basis）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "basis", "target_term": "基"}, {"source_term": "opens", "target_term": "开集"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射的"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "basis", "target_term": "基"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "引理所讨论的对象。"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆", "context": "限定所取的模。"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "带有所给结构的可逆模。"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集", "context": "用于假设中的“开集”。"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑", "context": "假设指定概形上所取的拓扑。"}, {"source_term": "basis", "target_term": "基", "context": "假设中的开集族构成拓扑的基。"}, {"source_term": "opens", "target_term": "开集", "context": "指代假设给出的开集族。"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集", "context": "用于结论中的“开集”。"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射的", "context": "限定结论中选取的开集。"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑", "context": "结论指定所得的基所对应的拓扑。"}, {"source_term": "basis", "target_term": "基", "context": "结论说明所选开集仍构成一个基。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01PX:proof", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>。取一个仿射开（affine open）邻域（neighbourhood）<MATH_0002>，使它包含<MATH_0003>。由假设，存在<MATH_0004>和<MATH_0005>，使得<MATH_0006>。由上面的引理（Lemma）<REF_0001>，交集（intersection）<MATH_0007>是仿射的（affine）。由于<MATH_0008>可以取得任意小（small），结论即得。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开"}, {"source_term": "neighbourhood", "target_term": "邻域"}, {"source_term": "Lemma", "target_term": "引理"}, {"source_term": "intersection", "target_term": "交集"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射的"}, {"source_term": "small", "target_term": "小"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开", "context": "作定语，限定所取邻域既仿射又开。"}, {"source_term": "neighbourhood", "target_term": "邻域", "context": "取给定点的邻域。"}, {"source_term": "Lemma", "target_term": "引理", "context": "引用上文的引理。"}, {"source_term": "intersection", "target_term": "交集", "context": "取两个开集的交集。"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射的", "context": "陈述交集的性质。"}, {"source_term": "small", "target_term": "小", "context": "说明邻域可以取得任意小。"}], "notes": []}
